   "originalText": "id, hotelId, bookingId, roomTypeId, bedType\nnights: Night[]   \u2190 THE UNIT (D-15)\n  Night { date, roomId?, rate, posted }\n  arrive/depart derived \u00b7 move never splits\nadults, children, guests: GuestId[]\nrouting? {category \u2192 own | master}  (group)\nstatus: booked | checkedIn | checkedOut |\n        cancelled | noShow\ncheckedInAt?, checkedOutAt?\n\nevents: stay.created \u00b7 room_assigned \u00b7 room_changed \u00b7\nnights_changed \u00b7 rate_set \u00b7 guest_added/removed \u00b7\nrouting_set \u00b7 checked_in \u00b7 checked_out \u00b7 cancelled \u00b7\nmarked_no_show \u00b7 overbooking_overridden",
