   "updated": 1790171010801,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "id, hotelId\nowner: stay (own) | booking (master)\nstatus: open | closed\nbalance = \u03a3charges \u2212 \u03a3voided \u2212 \u03a3payments + \u03a3refunds\n\nCharge { stayId, businessDate, categoryId,\n  itemId?, description, qty, unitPrice, voided? }\nPayment { businessDate, method: cash | bankTransfer\n  | card (word only), kind: deposit | settlement\n  | refund, amount, ref? }\n\nevents: folio.opened \u00b7 charge_posted \u00b7 charge_voided \u00b7\ncharge_moved \u00b7 payment_received \u00b7 payment_refunded \u00b7\ndeposit_forfeited \u00b7 transferred_to_receivable \u00b7 closed",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "id, hotelId\nowner: stay (own) | booking (master)\nstatus: open | closed\nbalance = \u03a3charges \u2212 \u03a3voided \u2212 \u03a3payments + \u03a3refunds\n\nCharge { stayId, businessDate, categoryId,\n  itemId?, description, qty, unitPrice, voided? }\nPayment { businessDate, method: cash | bankTransfer\n  | card (word only), kind: deposit | settlement\n  | refund, amount, ref? }\n\nevents: folio.opened \u00b7 charge_posted \u00b7 charge_voided \u00b7\ncharge_moved \u00b7 payment_received \u00b7 payment_refunded \u00b7\ndeposit_forfeited \u00b7 transferred_to_receivable \u00b7 closed",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
