   "locked": false,
   "text": "Front Desk  \u2014 receptionist \u00b7 owner\n  room map \u00b7 tape chart \u00b7 new booking \u00b7 booking page \u00b7 stay page \u00b7 folio (print) \u00b7 arrivals/departures \u00b7 search\nBack Office \u2014 owner \u00b7 receptionist (receivables, expenses)\n  dashboard \u00b7 receivables \u00b7 expenses \u00b7 reports (owner)\nSetup       \u2014 owner\n  CRUD per Setup item \u00b7 users + roles\n\nroles v1: receptionist, owner \u00b7 capability-based per command \u00b7 void/refund/write-off/transfer/setup/users = owner",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Front Desk  \u2014 receptionist \u00b7 owner\n  room map \u00b7 tape chart \u00b7 new booking \u00b7 booking page \u00b7 stay page \u00b7 folio (print) \u00b7 arrivals/departures \u00b7 search\nBack Office \u2014 owner \u00b7 receptionist (receivables, expenses)\n  dashboard \u00b7 receivables \u00b7 expenses \u00b7 reports (owner)\nSetup       \u2014 owner\n  CRUD per Setup item \u00b7 users + roles\n\nroles v1: receptionist, owner \u00b7 capability-based per command \u00b7 void/refund/write-off/transfer/setup/users = owner",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
